OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry and
OL,6,Fvery warm evening with plenty of late
OL,7,Fsunshine, however a very isolated
OL,8,Fshower is still possible. Overnight
OL,9,Fmore high cloud will spill in but it
OL,10,Fwill remain warm, leading to an
OL,11,Funcomfortable night to sleep.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FA sunny start, but cloud
OL,14,Ftending to increase leaving variable
OL,15,Fcloud and sunny spells. A few showers
OL,16,Falso developing come the afternoon,
OL,17,Fpossibly heavy in places.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
